<title>CANADA: Imasco Ltd Q1 profit jumps on gain.</title>
<headline>Imasco Ltd Q1 profit jumps on gain.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr			 C$1.60		   C$0.47</p>
<p> Net			372,000		  113,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,690,000		2,396,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 230,490		  232,521</p>
<p>		(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Latest first-quarter net profit includes a net gain of C$293 million or C$1.07 a share on the sale of the company's First Federal Savings and Loan Association of Rochester by CT Financial Services.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
